    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Climatic changes played a major role in human evolution. - Paleolithic humans adapted to fluctuating climates. - Mesolithic phase coincides with post-Ice Age warming. - Stable climate in Neolithic period supported agriculture.",
      "id": "2s5ytxk"
    },
